        "section_id": "temporal-trends",
        "title": "Temporal Price Trends & Volatility",
        "objective": "Analyze weekly and yearly price trends for each fuel type, identify periods of peak volatility (e.g., COVID-19 demand shock, 2022 energy crisis), and quantify the correlation between Brent Crude movements and retail price changes."
      },
      {
        "section_id": "regional-comparison",
        "title": "Regional Price Disparities",
        "objective": "Compare average fuel prices across the seven geographic regions, highlighting which regions consistently pay the most and least, and how regional spreads have evolved over time."
      },
      {
        "section_id": "subsidy-tax-analysis",
        "title": "Impact of Subsidies and Taxation on Retail Prices",
        "objective": "Evaluate how subsidy levels (High vs. Low) and tax percentages influence the retail price consumers pay, segmented by income level. Assess whether high-subsidy countries show lower price pass-through from crude oil fluctuations."
      },
      {
        "section_id": "income-level-segmentation",
        "title": "Fuel Affordability by Income Level",
        "objective": "Segment countries by income classification (High, Middle, Low) and analyze differences in fuel pricing, tax burden, and price stability to draw conclusions about energy equity."
      },
