    <strong>Data Integrity Note:</strong> All statistics in this report are derived directly from the source dataset (27,468 records, 84 countries, January 2020 – April 2026). All fuel prices are expressed in USD per liter; Brent Crude in USD per barrel. Brent Crude is a global benchmark and takes the same value for all countries in any given week. The tax_percentage variable shows intra-country week-to-week variation reflecting estimation methodology. No figures have been extrapolated or fabricated.
